{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42276","headline":"和江西萧少卿见寄二首 一 · 徐铉","name":"和江西萧少卿见寄二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"亡羊岐路媿司南，二纪穷通聚散三。\n老去何妨从笑傲，病来看欲嬾朝参。\n离肠似线常忧断，世态如汤不可探。\n珍重加餐省思虑，时时斟酒压山岚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42276.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42276","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}